      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28798:28800"
    },
    {
      "id": "122:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“茱莉不在。我们只是在这里借住。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28800:28819"
    },
    {
      "id": "122:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你确定？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28819:28827"
    },
    {
      "id": "122:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“非常确定，”你说道，“要帮你传话吗？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28827:28849"
    },
    {
      "id": "122:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“那马克呢？”他问道，“马克在吗？我也可以和马克谈。你见过马克吗？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28849:28885"
    },
    {
      "id": "122:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要询问陌生人是谁，转到 116。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28885:28903"
    },
    {
      "id": "122:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要告诉他马克也不在，转到 123。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28903:28922"
    },
    {
      "id": "122:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要让他离开，转到 117。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28922:28937"
    }
  ]
}
